# XcodeGen generates the project - never check it in
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace

.DS_Store
.build/
DerivedData/
*.xcuserstate
xcuserdata/
.swiftpm/
build/

# 2.7 GB - fetched with Werkzeuge/vlckit-fetch.sh
Vendor

# Private notes and docs live outside this repository and may be linked in
# as symlinks. The patterns have **no trailing slash**: with one, the rule
# does not match symlinks (this is how the Vendor symlink once slipped in).
CLAUDE.md
VERHALTEN.md
Erfahrungen.md
# Guard entry: keeps this private handbook out of the public repository.
GESTALTUNG.md
# Working documents like the three above (workflow and pitfalls). They
# belong in the working directory, not in the public repository.
ABLAUF.md
# **No trailing slash**, like the lines above: a directory turned into a
# symlink is no longer matched by `Fallen/`.
Fallen

# **Guard, not cleanup.** These paths live outside this repository and are
# not present here. The entries make sure they never get committed by
# accident. All **without a trailing slash**, otherwise the rule does not
# match symlinks.
AppStore
Entwuerfe
Rohbilder
Spec
Werkzeuge/Discord
Werkzeuge/Grafik
Werkzeuge/Iconbauer
# **Local agent folder.** Holds settings, skills and, under `worktrees/`,
# full copies of the working tree including private docs and raw assets.
# The patterns below match at any depth, but not README.md or project.yml
# inside such a copy.
.claude

# **Local deploy tool for the Linux machine.** It names hosts, paths and
# the Wayland session - tooling, not code.
.linux

MORGEN.md
OFFEN.md
PRUEFUNG.md
TESTEN.md
PLAYER-TVOS.md

# The Jellyfin web theme is a separate project and does not belong in the
# client.
Jellyfin-Theme

# Scratch folder of a local skill - intermediate output, not code.
.impeccable
__pycache__/

# **Credentials of the Trakt application** (client_id, client_secret). They
# exist only on the build machines; without the file the app has no Trakt.
# Format: see `TraktAccess` in `Trakt.swift`.
Packages/JellyfinKit/Sources/JellyfinKit/Resources/Trakt.json

# Copied from LICENSES/ during the build (Linux/build.sh) - never edit by hand.
Linux/Resources/Licenses/
Assets/SupporterIcons/ios/
Assets/SupporterIcons/macos/
Assets/SupporterIcons/tvos/
Assets/SupporterIcons/android/
Assets/SupporterIcons/preview/
